  "question": {
    "text": "If a directrix of a hyperbola centered at the origin and passing through the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;its eccentricity is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>e</mi></math>, then:",
